---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Join Us | IntelliSense Lab"
  description="PhD, master's, visiting student, and undergraduate research opportunities at IntelliSense Lab."
  headerMode="glass"
  bodyClass="space-theme"
>
  <main class="publication-archive join-page">
    <section class="publication-hero">
      <div class="container publication-hero-inner">
        <h1 class="publication-title" data-en="Join Us" data-zh="加入我们">Join Us</h1>
        <p
          class="publication-lede"
          data-en="We are always looking for highly self-motivated PhD/master students, visiting students, and undergraduate interns (RAs)."
          data-zh="我们长期招募积极主动、热爱科研的博士生、硕士生、访问学生及本科生科研实习生（RA）。"
        >We are always looking for highly self-motivated PhD/master students, visiting students, and undergraduate interns (RAs).</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section join-section" aria-label="How to join IntelliSense Lab">
      <div class="container join-details">
        <div class="join-row">
          <h2 data-en="Research directions" data-zh="研究方向">Research directions</h2>
          <p
            data-en="Computer vision, multi-modal LLMs, agents, few-shot learning, and remote-sensing intelligence."
            data-zh="计算机视觉、多模态大模型、智能体、小样本学习与遥感智能。"
          >Computer vision, multi-modal LLMs, agents, few-shot learning, and remote-sensing intelligence.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="join-row">
          <h2 data-en="Research environment" data-zh="科研环境">Research environment</h2>
          <p
            data-en="Strong computing resources and active collaborations; we encourage top-venue publications and academic exchange."
            data-zh="实验室有充足的算力资源和活跃的合作网络，鼓励大家在顶级会议与期刊发表成果，也支持参加学术交流。"
          >Strong computing resources and active collaborations; we encourage top-venue publications and academic exchange.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="join-row">
          <h2 data-en="How to apply" data-zh="申请方式">How to apply</h2>
          <div class="join-application">
            <p
              data-en="If you are interested, email Dr. Xu with your CV and transcript."
              data-zh="有意加入的同学，请把简历和成绩单发到许老师邮箱。"
            >If you are interested, email Dr. Xu with your CV and transcript.</p>
            <a
              class="join-email-button"
              href="mailto:xuwenjia@bupt.edu.cn?subject=Prospective%20student%20inquiry"
            >
              <span data-en="Email us" data-zh="发送邮件">Email us</span>
              <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .join-section {
    padding: 24px 0 120px;
  }

  .join-details {
    width: min(calc(100% - 96px), 1080px);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
  }

  .join-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(220px, 0.7fr) minmax(0, 1.5fr);
    gap: 80px;
    padding: 38px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  }

  .join-row:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .join-row h2,
  .join-row p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .join-row h2 {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.52);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.5;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .join-row p {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .join-application {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .join-email-button {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-height: 48px;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 28px;
    padding: 0 22px;
    border: 1px solid #ef4a45;
    border-radius: 4px;
    color: #fff;
    background: #e53935;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    transition: background 180ms ease, border-color 180ms ease, transform 180ms ease;
  }

  .join-email-button:hover {
    border-color: #c92f2b;
    background: #c92f2b;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .join-email-button span:last-child {
    font-size: 23px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .join-section {
      padding: 10px 0 80px;
    }

    .join-details {
      width: calc(100% - 40px);
    }

    .join-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 30px 0;
    }

    .join-row p {
      font-size: 17px;
    }
  }
</style>
